      'For those choosing an unrelated path, the same high-value skill portfolio logic applies as anywhere else: proof of work, market positioning, and a deliberate skill choice rather than a default',
    ],
  },
];

const tricityTourismSummaryItems = [
  {
    title: 'Three real local threads, one decision',
    body: 'A sports-career pathway, Tricity office work, and the pilgrimage-and-hill-tourism economy coexist in Panchkula without overlapping much - the useful question is which one, if any, actually fits your situation.',
  },
];

const areaItems = [
  {
    title: 'The stadium sector carries the sports-training and academy economy',
    body: 'The Tau Devi Lal Stadium complex and its surrounding sectors carry the sports-nursery and academy-training economy described above.',
  },
  {
    title: 'The planned office sectors carry the Tricity job-market economy',
